WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:02,750
I ask again

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:05,800
who fired the gun

3
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:09,500
Even a beast dares to stop Gongwu

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,700
I'm even with him

5
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:16,000
The gun you fired just now was Li Changsheng.

6
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,400
We are county leaders

7
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,600
Do you dare to use a gun against me?

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,000
I ask you

9
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:26,150
Did you prescribe longevity?

10
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:27,750
Don't risk anyone's life

11
00:00:27,950 --> 00:00:35,090
Say I said listen and don't move
